    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-text">
        <h1>Know what is on your shelves before a customer asks</h1>
        <p>Shelfmark counts every copy as it is sold, ordered, or returned, and tells you which titles to reorder on Monday morning.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="#">Start a 30-day trial</a>
          <a class="button button-secondary" href="#">See how it works</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="preview" aria-label="Stock list preview">
        <div class="preview-head">
          <span>Reorder this week</span>
